SOAPBOX: Low power this year, added wire antennas to vertical. Used IC7300 voice memory for callsign, Heil Pro 7 also in play. Switching between antennas and voice sources snagged extra log entries! First-ever 80M hopes were a bust - no contest action in the General sub-band. Put in full hours, low power dropped scores bigtime from past, but it was still fun and another learning experience. For many reasons, voice remains my least favorite contesting mode. Even with low power, I know many stations heard would've been logged if this was CW weekend, or even digital. Ah well. Tickled to work PJ4K & then V26B on "all bands" (40-10 for me), plus PJ4G & P40W on 40/15/10 & V47T on 20/15. GO FRC!
CREATED-BY: N1MM Logger+ 1.0.11469.0
